  "body": "Offering an impressive 59m² of internal living, this beautifully designed one-bedroom apartment with a separate flexi room delivers the space and versatility that is often hard to find in apartment living.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned at Amaia, 48 Esmonde Road, this is an opportunity to enjoy a connected lifestyle between the city and the coast. Takapuna Beach, cafés, restaurants and shopping are all within easy reach, while excellent motorway access and connections to Aucklands CBD makes commuting simple. \r\n\r\nThe generous bedroom provides a comfortable private retreat, while the additional flexi room, offers valuable extra space to adapt to your lifestyle. Use it as a home office, guest room, nursery or simply the additional storage space that makes everyday living easier.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is complemented by elegantly detailed interiors and a contemporary bathroom, creating a stylish and practical home designed for modern living. Chattels include new fridge and combined washing machine & dryer.\r\n\r\nWith excellent local school zones including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School and Westlake Girls' High School, this is an appealing option for first-home buyer, professionals and investors alike.\r\n\r\nCall to book a private viewing. Link to property docs https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/KHLV",
